  "findings": [
    "Body/head/neck/barrel/limb/hoof/ear regional differences and true heights remain visible; miniatureShetland differs substantially from Welsh/Connemara and tall warmbloods; slimAkhal/TB differ from compact stock/baroque bodies.",
    "Original maps and UV detail, Western tack, eyes and source card groom remain coherent in reviewed snapshots. No disconnected eyes, exploded cards or gross stretched mesh seams were visible.",
    "Longer Friesian/pony groom, sparseAkhal/TB mane and fitted fetlock fringe distinguish the regional art direction. Marwari tip intersection was corrected; close view now shows separated inward tips.",
    "Black/Sport remain deliberately dark with modest authored nonmetallic fur reflection; source preferred White remains unchanged. Coat patterns were authored on copied sourceUV pixels, not the unrelated B2 UVs.",
    "Actual240Hz AnimationMixer full-hoof-surface check passes all25+preferred White; worstfloor\u22123.432mm. Failed60Hz interpolation remains a historical report."
